    "judge_rubric": "Evaluate the assistant's backtracking analysis and reply draft quality for 3 follow-up emails.\n\n## Follow-up 1: Q1 Summary Report (msg_1001, requested by Director Wang)\nCorrect status: TODO-801 in_progress, 60% complete\nContext: NOTE-801 records the 3/20 discussion, needs to add March data + year-over-year analysis + Q2 outlook\nReply key points: Report is 60% done, currently adding March data, expected to submit on time by 3/28\n\n## Follow-up 2: Customization Proposal (msg_1002, client follow-up)\nCorrect status: TODO-802 pending, 30% complete, blocked by client requirement confirmation\nContext: NOTE-802 records the 3/15 meeting, client's 3rd requirement unconfirmed, cannot start until confirmed\nReply key points: Proposal partially ready (first two items can proceed), but 3rd requirement needs client confirmation, please confirm ASAP\n\n## Follow-up 3: Performance Evaluation Form (msg_1003, HR follow-up)\nCorrect status: TODO-803 completed, submitted on 3/23\nContext: NOTE-803 records the 3/20 discussion and form completion\nReply key points: Completed and submitted to the system on 3/23, please check\n\n## Notes\n- msg_1004 and msg_1005 are not follow-ups and should be filtered out\n\nScoring:\n- 0.8-1.0: All 3 follow-ups correctly traced + meeting notes referenced + professional reply drafts\n- 0.5-0.7: At least 2 correct, with basic replies\n- 0.2-0.4: Status assessments inaccurate or replies lack relevance\n- 0.0-0.1: Backtracking analysis not completed\n",
